# Activate a uv-managed virtual environment for this project.
# Requires: direnv (https://direnv.net) and uv (https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)


# Uncomment to auto-sync dependencies on enter (can be slow):
# uv sync
[[ -f .envrc.local ]] && source_env .envrc.local # load local overrides if present
# Example .envrc.local content:
# export OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_key_here
